title: "DOU and Federal Covenants for Research Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  Collect publications from the Brazilian official gazette and federal covenants from the Portal da
  Transparência, through the official open-data routes, with pagination, filter verification and an
  explicit refusal to circumvent access controls.
